comments.body:
@jleveque, this issue is fixed for platforms that return 'type_abbrv_name' for dynamic transceiver tuning by #2876.
But with the above PR, this testcase is now failing for platforms that currently do not return 'type_abbrv_name'.

Request your insights on whether it is expected that all platforms should return 'type_abbrv_name' irrespective of dynamic transceiver tuning support ?

@liat-grozovik: I understand your points. Eventually, we want all vendors to use the same SFP EEPROM parsing code, which is why we are going to refactor the sonic_sfp code to make it cleaner and easier to reuse.

In the interim, I have opened the following PR to address this. Please review: https://github.com/Azure/sonic-mgmt/pull/3120

@ArunSaravananBalachandran: please review, as well.
